yle=\"color:#18181B;word-break:break-all;text-decoration:underline\">{link}</a>}}</p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">Merci de rester avec nous!</p></td></tr><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px 0\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#9CA3AF;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">&copy; {app} &mdash; All rights reserved</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>"
  }
